Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.43,0:20:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,1014)\fad(150,150)\b0\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnDumpling-Regular\fs74.25}能唱能跳 這就是我的……
